milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-30T09:18:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T00:19:24Z","closed_at":"2026-10-06T00:19:24Z","assignee":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.stable.official.5b4e0cb0f\n- Not tested in earlier versions yet\n\n### System information\n\n- OS: Android 15 (OPPO, model PJY110) - GPU: ARM Mali-G68 MC4 - Rendering backend: Vulkan 1.3.278 - Forward Mobile - Build fingerprint: OPPO/PJY110/OP59FB:15/AP3A.240617.008/U.24ef95f-3bc4a:user/release-keys\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot crashes when the system font is changed while the app is in the background.\n\nThis happens on both the Android editor (org.godotengine.editor.v4) and an exported\ngame (com.mcfun.studio). It is 100% reproducible (3/3 attempts).\n\nAfter changing the system font in Android Settings and switching back to Godot, the\nfollowing is observed:\n1. The screen becomes slightly blurry (possibly the app being reloaded/restarted).\n2. The app freezes / stutters.\n3. The app force-closes, with no crash dialog.\n\nLog evidence shows the process is killed by the system without saving state\n(abnormal termination):\n\n    am_proc_died: [0,12488,org.godotengine.editor.v4,0,2]\n    wm_finish_activity: [...,proc died without state saved]\n\nThe crash buffer also contains a repeated fatal libc error at the same address,\nwhich points to a use-after-free / access to a destroyed object related to font\ncache invalidation:\n\n    F libc : FORTIFY: pthread_mutex_lock called on a destroyed mutex (0x77fb939388)\n    F libc : FORTIFY: pthread_mutex_lock called on a destroyed mutex (0x77fb939388)\n    F libc : FORTIFY: pthread_mutex_lock called on a destroyed mutex (0x77fb939388)\n\nThe same mutex address (0x77fb939388) is reported every time, suggesting a\nfont/TextServer object that has been destroyed but is still being accessed after\nthe system font configuration changed.\n\nNote: a native backtrace could not be captured because the logcat crash buffer had\nalready rolled over.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open the Godot Android editor (or an exported Godot app).\n2. Send the app to the background (go to the home screen).\n3. Open Android Settings and change the system font to a different one.\n4. Switch back to the Godot editor / exported app.\n5. The app briefly shows a blurry frame, stutters, then crashes.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A. The crash occurs with the editor itself and with an empty project, so any\nproject opened in the Android editor reproduces it.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124021/reactio